Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.91,0:00:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears you're out of options, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.43,0:01:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my nightmare\NSteelcade, you can't attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.39,0:01:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And in one more turn, you'll be finished\Nand your Millennium Puzzle will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.76,0:01:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I believe in\Nthe heart of the cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.85,0:01:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't succeed in claiming my puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.51,0:01:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your misguided faith is\Ncompletely pathetic when compared
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.65,0:01:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,to the overwhelming power\Nof my Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.63,0:01:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll see that first\Nhand in just one more turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.91,0:01:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,when my breeding machine\Nproduces the third slime token,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,giving me enough monsters to sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.47,0:01:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll summon my great beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.87,0:01:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,an ancient creature of unbeatable\Nstrength to destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.11,0:01:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All systems go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.57,0:01:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Commence download of\Nreal-time satellite imaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirm system data link\Nwith all active dual disks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.07,0:01:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Resume digital scan of Battle City Tournament\Ngameplay and card tracking software.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Progress report. Ah, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:01:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Has my satellite tracking\Nsystem recorded any
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.15,0:02:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,use of the two remaining\NEgyptian god cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But we are searching around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.27,0:02:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust even you won't\Nscrew up this assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.63,0:02:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done all the real work programming\Nmy satellite to track every card played.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.57,0:02:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Contact me immediately if an\NEgyptian god card appears. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.39,0:02:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised those cards\Nhaven't surfaced yet. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.31,0:02:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But if they had, our satellite\Nsystem would have picked them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.15,0:02:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, maybe it's time for me\Nto go out and find them on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My patience is growing thin. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,With all these rare hunters\Nrunning around the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet those Egyptian god cards\Nare right under our noses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.55,0:02:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I have all three, I'll have\Nthe most powerful deck in duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.63,0:02:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be unbeatable, and once again I'll\Nbe known as the world's greatest duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.21,0:02:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.25,0:02:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.35,0:03:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,History may be on your side, Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but destiny is on mine as I draw\Ncloser to winning your puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.29,0:03:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I possess it, only the final\NEgyptian god card will be left to claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.39,0:03:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,When I do, then I'll be the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not worthy of the powers that lie\Nhidden within you, so I'll take them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.31,0:03:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,For as long as I can remember, I was\Ntaught to obey the ancient scriptures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.77,0:03:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And to help my family\Nprotect the pharaohs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.49,0:03:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I realize that your time as pharaoh\Nhas expired, and I must take your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And your puzzle is the key to your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish that I knew more about\Nwhat happened in the ancient past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But for now, I know that\NI can't let Merrick win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.15,0:03:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good, because your\Ntime has run out anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.53,0:03:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Greening machine, create the\Nthird and final slime token.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.57,0:03:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be. He's succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have enough monsters\Nfor my ultimate sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.71,0:04:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, the time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.55,0:04:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky shall be shrouded in darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.35,0:04:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to experience an\Nancient force like no other!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.35,0:04:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,As I sacrifice Jambeater\Nand my three Slime Tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.35,0:04:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to summon the beast\Nof your ultimate destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.41,0:04:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A creature whose power\Nis absolutely limitless!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.13,0:04:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet your maker, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.75,0:04:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The last monster you'll ever see!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The Egyptian god Slifer the Sky Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.59,0:05:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to feel his wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.61,0:05:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staring into the\Nface of defeat, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer the Sky Dragon is one of the\Nthree most feared creatures in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The Egyptian god monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They cannot be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.59,0:05:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Every monster has a weakness,\NMerrick, and I'll find yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in no position to make threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trapped in my nightmare\Nsteel cage with no way to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're face to face with an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,god monster whose attack\Npower is limitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.89,0:05:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All you can do is watch it grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.19,0:05:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain how Slifer works.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The number of cards I hold in my hand\Ndetermines what Slifer's attack power will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:06:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I hold two cards,\Nit has 2,000 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid Slifer is still\Nweaker than my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to my magic card,\NI activate Pot of Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.91,0:06:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This card allows me to draw two new cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.81,0:06:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Greed is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.19,0:06:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost one card but gained two,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,giving me a total of three cards and\NSlifer a total of 3,000 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But in Duel Monsters, there's a limit\Nto how many cards a player can hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.77,0:06:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So Slifer the Sky Dragon\Nhas a limit to its strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish Pharaoh, don't you realize\Nthat every rule is made to be broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.49,0:06:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no understanding of the\Ndestructive force of an Egyptian god
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.67,0:06:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,monster because he has no memory of the\Ndays when they devastated the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But he'll learn about Slifer's\Npower the hard way since I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.53,0:06:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,have just the cards to give my\Nsky dragon infinite strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.63,0:06:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid any hopes you have\Nof survival are completely
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.09,0:07:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,in vain for no one has ever\Ndefeated an Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.45,0:07:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Until now. You're our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.07,0:07:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniper will wipe you out\Nwith one single attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.11,0:07:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take your puzzle and send\Nyou to a place of eternal darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.19,0:07:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.19,0:07:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, prepare to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta figure out a way to\Nbring down Merrick's dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My Buster Blader receives 500 attack\Npoints for every dragon on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.59,0:07:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So right now, my monster is\Nstronger than his Sky Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.35,0:07:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,With 3,100 attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.15,0:07:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,my swordsman would slay Merrick's\Ndragon with one swipe of his lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But as long as I'm in this cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.77,0:07:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't attack And by the time I can\Nattack, his monster may be too strong
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.69,0:07:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, my Sky Dragon will only\Nget stronger as I draw more cards
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.79,0:07:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So when I draw on my next turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.21,0:07:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer will have 4,000 attack points\NMore than enough to annihilate
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:08:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Buster Blader and seriously damage\Nyour life points. Then soon enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.43,0:08:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be out of my way
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reign is over, Yami! Hand over\Nthat puzzle and accept the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll trust my deck
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This card may be able to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.07,0:08:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm still trapped for one more\Nturn If I can hang on until then,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe I can turn this duel\Naround I just have to trust
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,the heart of the cards\NThis duel is far from over,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick How sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.61,0:08:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.93,0:08:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just embrace it. You've had\Nyour chance to be fair, Oyami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.35,0:08:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for me to take\Nover and rule the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if I can help it, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my destiny to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.41,0:08:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place these two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.89,0:08:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I summon Koribo in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the moment has now arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:09:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to feel the wrath\Nof an Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The steel cage is evaporating, leaving\Nyou wide open for annihilation!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You are about to witness\Nan ancient force so
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.37,0:09:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,mighty it almost destroyed\Nthe entire world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.41,0:09:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You are powerless against Slifer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.57,0:09:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this! I draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and since Slifer gets 1,000 attack\Npoints for every card in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.21,0:09:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's up to 4,000, enough to\Nincinerate your buster flader.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.61,0:09:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my Egyptian god monster, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.03,0:09:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You've activated my trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.49,0:09:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Trap card?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.59,0:09:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My light force sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.49,0:09:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This trap card allows me to slash one card
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,out of your hand for the\Nduration of the turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,which lowers your dragon's\Nattack points back to 3,000,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.45,0:09:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,making it weaker than my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.69,0:10:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Buster Blader, swing your\Nmighty sword and slay his dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.77,0:10:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Egyptian god card is defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.73,0:10:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot my jam\Ndefender is still in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,which means my revival jam will\Nintercept all your attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.49,0:10:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And from now on, this magic\Ncard will also be in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.81,0:10:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Card of Safe Return!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.83,0:10:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Card of Safe Return?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.66,0:10:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,this rare magic card\Nlets me draw three new
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.39,0:10:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,cards every time my gem\Ndefender reforms itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.07,0:10:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This brings the cards\Nin my hand up to five,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.77,0:10:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,giving Slifer the Sky Dragon a grand\Ntotal of 5,000 attack points so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.43,0:10:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,5,000 points? Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have challenged him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.53,0:10:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You would have destroyed\Nhim one, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:10:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:11:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just two locator\Ncards away from the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.21,0:11:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a lightweight. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.39,0:11:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a reputation to uphold over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go dueling every\Ninexperienced chump I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.46,0:11:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're out of your mind, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, I don't care if that guy\Ncouldn't even play Go Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,His locator cards are just as good as\Nanyone else's, and you need them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Tristan, you don't\Nunderstand how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.81,0:11:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I came in second place in Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.15,0:11:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That puts a lot of pressure on me to kick\Nsome serious geester in this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.77,0:11:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's going to claim Joey\NWheeler did it the easy way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, after the way I've\Nbeen dueling lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'm ready to take\Non anyone in Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.73,0:11:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And I mean anyone! Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.55,0:11:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,it's true your dueling skills\Nhave improved quite a bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.77,0:11:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,especially during your last two duels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.65,0:11:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But besides having\Nconfidence in oneself, Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.71,0:11:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,being a great duelist means knowing\Nthat there's always more to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.51,0:11:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.47,0:11:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.39,0:11:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is a complete amateur like you\Nwearing one of my dual discs, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.19,0:12:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Amateur?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.21,0:12:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like someone screwed\Nup at registration.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.67,0:12:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with you later. Come on, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.19,0:12:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We've wasted enough time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.61,0:12:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, I think I feel a\Nchallenge coming on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should save\NKaiba for the finals, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you want a piece of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.51,0:12:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.42,0:12:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You might want to rethink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody disses me in front of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.19,0:12:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, you're an okay duelist and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.47,0:12:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but playing against you would be a\Ncomplete waste of my big brother's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.03,0:12:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.61,0:12:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's rock and roll, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.55,0:12:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'll have to teach you to\Nbehave, just like the dog you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.27,0:12:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you're toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.39,0:13:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all this wind, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.81,0:13:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a twister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.21,0:13:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your chopper. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, an Egyptian god card was\Nplayed exactly five minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.13,0:13:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll fly you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.51,0:13:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.89,0:13:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's dueling to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.97,0:13:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.05,0:13:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.11,0:13:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a date with\Nan Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.91,0:13:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's your lucky day, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.11,0:13:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to wipe the street with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You better run from me. Whew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.09,0:13:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, did you see the way he took off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.45,0:13:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You can drop the act.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.71,0:13:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe, Joey. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.77,0:13:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have crushed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.57,0:13:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,More information has just come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.15,0:13:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Egyptian God card was activated\Nin a duel involving Yu-Gi-Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:14:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I have a plan, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That card will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Slifer the Sky Dragon,\Ndestroy his Buster Blader!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.37,0:14:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And take a bite out of his life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.33,0:14:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you surrender yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.15,0:14:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.06,0:14:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer will only get stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and thanks to my jam defender,\Nyou still can't attack Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.65,0:14:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For if you do, I'll draw more cards and\NSlifer will grow even more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.81,0:14:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize there's\Nno way you can win?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over your puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.99,0:14:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Once my Egyptian God card finishes you\Noff, your days as Pharaoh will be over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.63,0:14:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,None of my monsters are strong\Nenough to beat a Sky Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.73,0:14:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm gonna need the\Nright magic card to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Heart of the Cards. Guide me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.47,0:14:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic Cylinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.05,0:15:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This card could do the trick,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but it has to be combined\Nwith a Magician card to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm in luck, because I'm\Nholding the Dark Magician Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.31,0:15:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice Coribo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,to summon Dark Magician\NGirl in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.65,0:15:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,By summoning a new monster to the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.53,0:15:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you've activated my\Ndragon's special ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.65,0:15:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Its second mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniper is full of surprises!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's your turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.19,0:15:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniper will automatically attack every
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.27,0:15:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,monster you summon with\Nits second set of jaws,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.35,0:15:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,wiping out 2,000 points from\Nwhichever mode your monster is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.33,0:15:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So say goodbye to your\NDark Magician Girl! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.01,0:15:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She only has 1,700 defense points!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.47,0:15:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sliver, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to save\Nmy Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late! Observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you observe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is a pity that your\NMagician had to leave us so soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said she's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.77,0:16:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I activated Magical Hats just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.45,0:16:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So she's hiding inside one of those hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.39,0:16:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She's inside preparing to\Nlaunch a counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.65,0:16:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, your monster's not strong\Nenough not to defeat Slifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.65,0:16:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that your dragon\Nis powerful, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And so I place two cards face\Ndown beneath my Magical Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.85,0:16:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hats merely provide you with a\Ntemporary hiding place And in the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play my own magic card. And it will
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.01,0:17:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Make my dragon's power infinite. You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.29,0:17:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,infinite cards let me\Nexceed the six-card limit
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.39,0:17:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And hold as many cards\Nas I wish in my hand No,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.37,0:17:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,that can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.53,0:17:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Slifer gets 1,000\Nattack points for every card
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.23,0:17:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,in my hand Now there's no\Nlimit to my monster's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.65,0:17:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer, unleash your thunder\Nforce on the right hand's hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a lucky guess, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.93,0:17:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't hide her forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It may as well be your\Nmonster is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.95,0:17:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.65,0:17:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She's absorbing my attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.95,0:17:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.41,0:17:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you have forgotten I also\Nhid two trap cards under that hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.41,0:17:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic Cylinder and my Spellbinding Circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll weaken your Sky\NDragon's power and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.71,0:18:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,redirect his own Thunder Force\Nattack right back at him! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.71,0:18:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't attack me with\Nmy Revival Jam in play!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.87,0:18:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So your plasma monster can\Neven block redirected attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.49,0:18:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly right, Barrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.11,0:18:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it regenerates unharmed, which\Nalso means I can draw three new cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.83,0:18:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So my Sky Dragon grows even stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.81,0:18:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I'll draw again, giving it a\Ntotal of over 8,000 attack points!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That Egyptian god is\Nunstoppable! Precisely!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.91,0:18:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And since your Spellbinding\NCircle card has expired,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.19,0:18:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer gains back more attack\Npoints, giving it 9,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.51,0:18:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Slifer, demolish\Nhis Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.33,0:19:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, the ultimate five-card combination\Nthat makes me completely indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.29,0:19:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,When these five almighty\Ncards are played together,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.69,0:19:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,they complete a strategy\Nthat cannot be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.97,0:19:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My Egyptian god card will\Ncontinue to grow stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and your attacks are completely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.05,0:19:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Merrick win my puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on your feet, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.57,0:19:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.05,0:19:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when do you bow to your rivals?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.43,0:19:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then get up and stop embarrassing\Nyourself So you can defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.51,0:19:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,this nobody And relieve him of his\NEgyptian God card And do it now
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.47,0:19:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let this punk win.\NYou can take down Slifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.05,0:19:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the Sky Dragon Just find\Nout its weakness Unless,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.81,0:19:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,of course, you've lost your touch
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.33,0:20:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you still have what it takes\NThen get up and prove it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.93,0:20:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now once I learn its weakness, I'll\Ntake Slifer from Yugi, and soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.91,0:20:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have the most\Npowerful deck in the world!
